Earth is a world apart from [[Geography/Færrin/index|Færrin]], far enough that the affairs of the Astra do not reach it. It is a [[Phenomena/Crystal Sphere|Crystal Sphere]] found on the far rim of the [[Geography/index|Astra]]. It is modern, a world of cities and machines. [[Geography/Urth/Los Diablos|Los Diablos]] is a city of California in the Great American Federation, and the animation studio [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/index|Bisney and Dixar]] works there.
